					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "FUNDAMENTALS 1 - NAVIGATION\n\nWelcome to Resolume Wire.\nWire is Resolume's node-based patching environment, which is used to create new effects, sources and other tools for Resolume Arena and Avenue.\n\nThe Fundamental tutorials will help you to get familiar with the software.\nIn this first tutorial we'll have a look at navigating the interface.\n\nAll tutorials assume that you are using the default layout.\nTo make sure you are using the default layout: navigate to the \"View\" menu, select Layout and then Default."
					}
				},
