					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TRANSPORT\n\nThe Transport bar can be found at the top of the interface, just below the name of the patch.\nIt contains the current BPM, time signature, start, stop and pause buttons.\nThe transport bar is used for nodes that listen to the BPM, like the Transport Beat node below.\nThe set in Wire is not carried over to Arena\/Avenue, your patch will always use the BPM of the application it is hosted in.\n\nAssignment: Click on the Mirror Quad node and pin it to the monitor. Next, hit the play button in the transport bar. Next, change the BPM by clicking on the BPM value and typing in a new one."
					}
				},
